	It seems you can unwield a cursed weapon by Engraving, and
selecting an engraving object other than the one you are wielding.
This fix allows you to engrave with any object (or pair of hands) you
specify, but will not unwield the cursed weapon.  If your engraving
leads you to wielding a cursed weapon, you are informed.

						SMC

